---
import AdminLayout from '../../../layouts/AdminLayout.astro';
---

<AdminLayout title="Cancelar Envios" activeTab="broadcasts">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[60vh] text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    
    <div class="w-24 h-24 bg-red-600/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-8 border border-red-600/50 shadow-lg shadow-red-600/20 animate-pulse">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-12 w-12 text-red-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Zona de Perigo</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg mb-8">Esta ação irá <strong class="text-white">interromper imediatamente</strong> todos os disparos de campanhas em andamento. Use apenas em casos de emergência (erro no copy, link quebrado, etc).</p>

    <div class="bg-red-950/30 border border-red-900/50 p-6 rounded-xl w-full mb-8 text-left">
       <h3 class="text-red-400 font-bold mb-2">Campanhas Ativas neste momento:</h3>
       <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300">
          <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-green-500 rounded-full mr-2"></span> Promoção Relâmpago (WhatsApp) - 45% completo</li>
          <li class="flex items-center"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-green-500 rounded-full mr-2"></span> Newsletter Semanal (Email) - 12% completo</li>
       </ul>
    </div>

    <button class="w-full bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white font-black text-xl py-6 rounded-xl shadow-xl shadow-red-600/30 transition-transform active:scale-95 border-2 border-red-500/50">
       PARAR TUDO AGORA 🛑
    </button>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-gray-600">Esta ação será logada e notificada aos administradores.</p>

  </div>
</AdminLayout>
